   "lines": [
    "Church in morning;",
    "walked home with",
    "Miss Wheelright. In",
    "afternoon drove over",
    "with Minot in his",
    "tilbury to Dick",
    "Saltonstalls, where",
    "we took tea and",
    "came home at 10",
    "oclock by moon",
    "light. Miss Alice",
    "Lee was there, as",
    "sweet and pretty",
    "as ever; and I",
    "enjoyed myself",
    "most heartily."
   ],
